      "title": "Adaptive LTXV image-to-video",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Adaptive LTXV I2V\n\nThe source image is scaled to 0.55 megapixels while preserving its aspect ratio and rounding both dimensions to a multiple of 32. The derived width and height drive the LTX latent, so portrait, landscape, and square inputs no longer inherit a hard-coded shape.\n\nDefaults: 121 frames (8n+1), 24 fps, 26 steps, I2V strength 0.80. Use the 0.40 MP workflow for drafts and 0.55 MP for the 16 GB quality path. The installed LTX 0.9.8 model remains in use; LTX 2.3 requires a separate 32 GB+/100 GB model migration."
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
