      "title": "Positive motion prompt",
      "properties": {
        "cnr_id": "comfy-core",
        "ver": "0.26.0",
        "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Animate from image 1 toward the end-frame guide in image 2 as one continuous cinematic shot. Preserve the same identity, head size, body proportions, clothing, and environment. Use image 1 as the exact opening frame and image 2 as the final pose/composition guide. The transition should be slow, stable, physically plausible, and free of morphing or cuts."
      ]
    },
